sequenceDiagram
 actor U as Owner browser
 participant P as Cloudflare proxy
 participant A as API
 participant D as PostgreSQL
 participant S as Spotify Accounts / API
 U->>P: GET /auth/spotify/start
 P->>A: Request + proxy secret
 A->>D: Store hashed state / browser binding / encrypted PKCE verifier
 A-->>U: OAuth redirect + secure binding cookie
 U->>S: Consent with PKCE challenge
 S-->>U: Redirect to callback with code + state
 U->>P: GET /auth/spotify/callback
 P->>A: Forward callback
 A->>D: Consume matching state once
 A->>S: Exchange code + verifier
 A->>S: GET /me
 A->>D: Bind immutable owner, encrypted tokens + session hash
 D->>D: Enqueue initial library import
 A-->>U: HttpOnly session cookie + redirect home
 U->>P: GET /api/session
 P->>A: Cookie + proxy secret
 A->>D: Resolve session + current account epoch
 A-->>U: Redacted session state